  "version": "1.0",
  "meta": {
    "id": "teaching-building",
    "name": {
      "zh": "三层教学楼（B-A 楼层模型种子场景）",
      "en": "Three-storey teaching building (B-A floor-model seed scenario)"
    },
    "description": {
      "zh": "三层教学楼种子场景（B-A 楼层模型，平面 24×10m，x 右/y 下，原点左上，各层共用平面坐标）：每层 2 间教室 + 1 条走廊 + 1 个楼梯井，楼梯井跨层显式邻接（stairwell-f0↔f1↔f2）是楼层间唯一热耦合通道；storeyHeight=3.5m，slabAttenuation 缺省 0.15，envelopeU 缺省 0.1；outdoor 经围护与 1F 走廊单向耦合。教室带声明式 occupantSchedule（8:00–18:00 满员 40 人，午间/夜间由课表事件覆盖为 5/0）；14:00 冷空气过境示例（outdoor 降至 18°C 持续生效）。验证点：楼下开空调不影响楼上非井道房间；井道上下层缓慢耦合；室外降温经围护缓慢渗入邻接房间；上课时段教室 CO2 上升；内嵌 Flow 在教室满员升温时确定性开空调制冷、18:00 课后确定性关闭全部教室空调（本场景无照明执行器，节能策略落在空调上）。（v2 刷新：内嵌 2 条确定性 Flow）（v2.2 刷新：全部 agent 配置 LLM）",
      "en": "Three-storey teaching-building seed (B-A floor model, 24×10m footprint per floor, x right / y down, origin top-left, shared plan per storey): each floor has 2 classrooms + 1 corridor + 1 stairwell, with stairwells explicitly adjacent across storeys (stairwell-f0↔f1↔f2) as the only cross-floor thermal channel; storeyHeight=3.5m, slabAttenuation defaults to 0.15, envelopeU defaults to 0.1; the outdoors couples one-way to the 1F corridor via the envelope. Classrooms carry declarative occupant schedules (08:00–18:00 ×40, midday/night overridden by timetable events to 5/0); a 14:00 cold-air-outbreak example drops the outdoors to 18°C persistently. Verification points: lower-floor AC does not affect non-stairwell upper rooms; the stairwell couples slowly across storeys; outdoor cooling seeps through the envelope; classroom CO₂ climbs during class; the embedded flows deterministically cool a classroom when a full class heats it and shut all classroom AC units off after the 18:00 last class (this seed has no lighting actuators, so the after-class energy-saving policy lands on AC). (v2 refresh: 2 embedded deterministic flows) (v2.2 refresh: all agents LLM-configured)"
    },
    "tagline": {
      "zh": "40 人涌进教室，温度与 CO₂ 同步爬升——一栋教学楼的课表日常与跨层热耦合实验场",
      "en": "Forty students walk in, temperature and CO₂ climb together — a school-day timetable plus cross-floor thermal coupling lab."
    },
    "heroEventId": "class-101-start",
    "recommendedPlaybackRate": 30,
    "storeyHeight": 3.5
  },
